@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ArrowColor #466482
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #9AA8B8
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #334155
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #94A3B8
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam sequenceParticipantPadding 18
skinparam maxMessageSize 240
hide footbox
autonumber
!include course-notation.iuml
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor transparent
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor transparent
title A 现状业务序列：推文协作

actor "需求方" as D
participant "<$worker>\n部长" as M
participant "<$worker>\n排版干事" as W
participant "<$worker>\n一审老师" as T1
participant "<$worker>\n二审老师" as T2
participant "<$entity>\n稿件材料" as A
D -> M : 在群里说明需求并发送素材
M -> W : 转述需求并安排排版
W -> A : 制作排版稿与附件
activate A
A --> W : 排版链接
deactivate A
W -> M : 提交排版链接
M -> T1 : 向一审群转发稿件
T1 -> W : 在群聊中说明修改要求
W -> A : 修订稿件
W -> T2 : 修改后转二审群
T2 -> W : 在另一群确认或要求修改
W -> M : 发出发布结果
note over M,T2
意见散落多个群，难以定位具体版本；
完成材料与后续工时表需再次人工关联。
end note

@enduml
